\newlabel{tab:second_order_hmm_emissions}{{9}{2}{Estimated emission parameters for the AR(1) second-order HMM. Each row is a state pair $(s_{t-1}, s_t)$; $\hat {\mu }$ and $\hat {\sigma }$ are the Gaussian mean and standard deviation of the residual and $\hat {\phi }$ is the AR(1) coefficient}{table.caption.9}{}}
