\newlabel{tab:ar_2_second_order_hmm_transition}{{12}{5}{Estimated transition probabilities for the AR(2) second-order HMM. Each row is a state pair $(s_{t-1}, s_t)$; columns give the next-state probability $P(s_{t+1} \mid s_{t-1}, s_t)$. A dash ($-$) indicates zero or negligible probability}{table.caption.12}{}}
